        "message": "LU-20656 efalnd: Check interface name before allocating NI\n\nValidate the interface name early in kefalnd_startup before allocating\nthe NI struct. This avoids allocation and teardown on a trivially\ninvalid configuration and the call to shutdown without initialized\ninterface name.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Michael Margolin <mrgolin@amazon.com>\nChange-Id: Ibb407f0bfcf069f647d52945977cf6a1f5610587\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/68552\nReviewed-by: Yonatan Nachum <ynachum@amazon.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Tom Sela <tomsela@amazon.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\n"
